<title>SLOVAKIA: Details of Slovak November CPI figures - SUSR.</title>
<headline>Details of Slovak November CPI figures - SUSR.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of Slovak consumer inflation (CPI) for November, as released by the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) on Thursday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION    Nov '96    Oct '96    Nov '95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		  0.4	  0.7	  0.4</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		  5.4	  5.3	  7.6</p>
<p>Foodstuffs</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	  0.2	  0.9	  0.1</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	    3.3	  3.3	  6.1</p>
<p>Non-food items</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	  0.5	  0.5	  0.5</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	    6.5	  6.5	  8.2</p>
<p>Public catering</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	  0.5	  0.7	  0.4</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	    5.8	  5.7	  8.0</p>
<p>Services</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	  0.3	  0.4	  0.1</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	    5.3	  5.1	  8.2</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3688</p>
</text>
